      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start and feels professional. \n\nHowever, I just ran this draft through a test version of the ESG engine, and the score came back lower than I expected. I think we might be missing some opportunities to emphasize our progress. \n\nCan you take another pass at it? Try to slightly increase the density of those key terms to bolster the score, but I'll say it again—please don't let it become nonsensical or obvious. It still needs to read like a serious, high-level corporate summary for our investors. We need a higher tier, but we can't afford to look like we're just padding the text.",
